{"1677110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lightyear Frontier", "steam_appid": 1677110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2655090, 2881710], "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/5e56dfe5ee297f3d845eefe23185f731.avif?t=1772726470\" width=1560 height=1950 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle your interstellar homestead in this open-world mech farming adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your farm, customize your mech, grow alien crops, and explore a vast new world full of promise with up to three friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/69125bcc76dc66673db32c5a1d491876.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/effa4d1105464c6b6d71eaea444baf75.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/effa4d1105464c6b6d71eaea444baf75.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/effa4d1105464c6b6d71eaea444baf75.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm, build, and explore in a customizable mech! Craft new parts and mod chips to tweak your mech's performance to your specifications. Choose from an array of options to build your trusty all-purpose vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/b214e053b200e056aedd528cf1d5989a.webp?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=51 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/e19c965f287adb34a78e110e7df88caf.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/e19c965f287adb34a78e110e7df88caf.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/e19c965f287adb34a78e110e7df88caf.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle on a verdant exoplanet in the Lightyear Frontier, a cluster of habitable worlds in the far reaches of the galaxy. Overcome its environmental challenges in order to thrive on your new home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/48ae1d0a748859423c09b1a94b1a0ab5.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3541e541ba8212ce64eff20c9e7edc84.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3541e541ba8212ce64eff20c9e7edc84.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3541e541ba8212ce64eff20c9e7edc84.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take farming to a new level with the power of the mech. Use its mighty tools to plant, water, and harvest vast fields of alien crops with ease. Mastering crop rotation is key to optimize your yield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ec9b015e8cc92f2636813d1b03bf2be3.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/03f02d47525da5797319462e825760e4.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/03f02d47525da5797319462e825760e4.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/03f02d47525da5797319462e825760e4.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the exofarm of your dreams! Make your mark on the world as you build your homestead piece by piece into a handcrafted retro-futuristic farm. Make your place your own with alternative color palettes and decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ccc3b965677294432d6914e2a900dbea.webp?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=51 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3acfd6cca39ffabf5933ba1491814a17.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3acfd6cca39ffabf5933ba1491814a17.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3acfd6cca39ffabf5933ba1491814a17.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send resources to remote colonies, befriend interplanetary neighbors, and build a stable of alien livestock. Use the bounty of your harvest to benefit those around you and create a better tomorrow.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/13e5619790b19ad53f01966485b364b3.webp?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ae39a78ece1b0494757120a6300f5096.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ae39a78ece1b0494757120a6300f5096.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ae39a78ece1b0494757120a6300f5096.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your mech can handle anything the world throws at you, feel free to invite up to three friends to join you on this journey of settling and exploration! Pool your resources to create the perfect homestead, and share the rewarding feeling of a good harvest with your pals!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle your interstellar homestead in this open-world mech farming adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your farm, customize your mech, grow alien crops, and explore a vast new world full of promise with up to three friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/69125bcc76dc66673db32c5a1d491876.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/effa4d1105464c6b6d71eaea444baf75.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/effa4d1105464c6b6d71eaea444baf75.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/effa4d1105464c6b6d71eaea444baf75.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm, build, and explore in a customizable mech! Craft new parts and mod chips to tweak your mech's performance to your specifications. Choose from an array of options to build your trusty all-purpose vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/b214e053b200e056aedd528cf1d5989a.webp?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=51 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/e19c965f287adb34a78e110e7df88caf.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/e19c965f287adb34a78e110e7df88caf.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/e19c965f287adb34a78e110e7df88caf.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle on a verdant exoplanet in the Lightyear Frontier, a cluster of habitable worlds in the far reaches of the galaxy. Overcome its environmental challenges in order to thrive on your new home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/48ae1d0a748859423c09b1a94b1a0ab5.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3541e541ba8212ce64eff20c9e7edc84.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3541e541ba8212ce64eff20c9e7edc84.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3541e541ba8212ce64eff20c9e7edc84.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take farming to a new level with the power of the mech. Use its mighty tools to plant, water, and harvest vast fields of alien crops with ease. Mastering crop rotation is key to optimize your yield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ec9b015e8cc92f2636813d1b03bf2be3.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/03f02d47525da5797319462e825760e4.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/03f02d47525da5797319462e825760e4.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/03f02d47525da5797319462e825760e4.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the exofarm of your dreams! Make your mark on the world as you build your homestead piece by piece into a handcrafted retro-futuristic farm. Make your place your own with alternative color palettes and decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ccc3b965677294432d6914e2a900dbea.webp?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=51 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3acfd6cca39ffabf5933ba1491814a17.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3acfd6cca39ffabf5933ba1491814a17.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3acfd6cca39ffabf5933ba1491814a17.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send resources to remote colonies, befriend interplanetary neighbors, and build a stable of alien livestock. Use the bounty of your harvest to benefit those around you and create a better tomorrow.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/13e5619790b19ad53f01966485b364b3.webp?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ae39a78ece1b0494757120a6300f5096.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ae39a78ece1b0494757120a6300f5096.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ae39a78ece1b0494757120a6300f5096.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your mech can handle anything the world throws at you, feel free to invite up to three friends to join you on this journey of settling and exploration! Pool your resources to create the perfect homestead, and share the rewarding feeling of a good harvest with your pals!</p>", "short_description": "In Lightyear Frontier you use your powerful trusty mech to farm on a large beautiful alien planet. Settle your homestead, farm and deliver produce to remote colonies, gather and manage resources, build, craft, explore, expand, improve your mech, meet neighbors, and make a place to call your own.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“A novel, refreshing approach to the farming sim genre”<br>GamesRadar<br><br>“My favourite comfort game.”<br>Twinfinite<br><br>“As with any survival-crafting-farming game in early access, Lightyear Frontier will only grow and evolve – but unlike many of its contemporaries, it already feels like a complete experience.”<br>GodIsAGeek<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/844594bbf4004922873cbe54ca447bd83a2e7293/header.jpg?t=1772726470", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/e742cb82c0087538dfc4b262a1010c242350af82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772726470", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/e742cb82c0087538dfc4b262a1010c242350af82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772726470", "website": "https://lightyearfrontier.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum"